{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Side-Scrolling Platformer Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an exhilarating Metroidvania-style adventure that seamlessly blends classic platforming dynamics with the thrilling intensity of twin-stick shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/BH1_1.gif?t=1744634037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse arsenal of guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a diverse arsenal of guns, offering unique ways to conquer challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/BH4_2.gif?t=1744634037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Helpful Pick-Ups and Portals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find strategic items along the way to aid with progression. Use the portals to backtrack to pickup healing items that were left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/BH.gif?t=1744634037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Player Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become stronger by finding new heart containers. Upgrade shield , dash and bullet booster specifications to make them last longer and reduce cooldown time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Player Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to welcome players of all skill levels. Blast Hopper avoids the steep learning curve, making it perfect for both casual play and thrilling adventure. Embrace the fun and excitement as you jump, shoot, and dash your way through a world rich with discovery and action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2737680?t=1744634037","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2737680?t=1744634037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744634037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744634037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Side-Scrolling Platformer Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an exhilarating Metroidvania-style adventure that seamlessly blends classic platforming dynamics with the thrilling intensity of twin-stick shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/BH1_1.gif?t=1744634037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse arsenal of guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a diverse arsenal of guns, offering unique ways to conquer challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/BH4_2.gif?t=1744634037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Helpful Pick-Ups and Portals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">F